               <provenance type="#e" source="7810"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_426">Oxford, Oxfordshire.
                        Balliol College (Domus de Balliolo)</orgName><p>‘From the cistercian abbey
                        of Buildwas (Shropshire), though the evidence for this has now disappeared:
                        Langbaine says ‘Donum Willelmi Gray, sed (quod ex initio constat) fuit olim
                        “Liber sanctae Mariae de Bildewas”. Prae vetustate fatiscit, et operimenti
                        parte dimidia, posteriori scilicet, mulctatus est.’’ (Mynors, Balliol,
                        178)</p><p>‘Liber domus de Balliolo in Oxon’ ex | dono Reverendi in Christo
                        patris et domini domini Willelmi Gray Eliensis Episcopi’ (fol.
                        206)</p><p>See also under Buildwas</p></provenance>
